Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.756
This one's from @TracedThurman?

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.558
-Oh.
-Traced.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.560
Traced.
-Traced?

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.195
-Traced.
-Traced, like tracing

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.330
a piece of paper,
like you trace this?

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.732
-Like Thurman was
traced by the --

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.602
-Like, maybe on the phone?
Like a traced phone call?

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:17.737
Or trace as in traced paper.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:18.838
-Hold on.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:22.909
-[ Imitating phone ringing ]

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.244
-Hello?
-[ Imitating phone ringing ]

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:27.914
-Oh, sorry.
-[ Imitating phone ringing ]

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.249
-Hello?

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:30.817
Hello?
-[ Woman's voice ] Hello, yes?

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.651
-Oh, hi.
Did I call you?

00:02:32.651 --> 00:02:35.321
-Yeah, you just called me.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:38.758
Oh, I just -- Is this Thurman?
-Yeah, it is.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:41.094
-Oh, cool.
I'll call you right back.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:42.361
-Okay.

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.463
--[ Imitating phone ringing ]

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:47.400
-Hello.
-Denver police department.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.669
-Yeah, did you trace the call?
-Yes, I did.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.337
It's coming from
inside the house.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.738
-No!

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:57.343
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:58.677
Coming from inside the house.

00:02:58.677 --> 00:03:00.713
-So, Thurman was --
-Oh, my wife's name is Thurman,

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.316
I apologize, officer.
-Yeah, he's not theremin.

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:06.152
-No.
@Tracedthurman.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:09.122 line:0%
His dog's costume is
Furry Kreuger.

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:12.392 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:14.894 line:0%
He licks you in your sleep.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.829 line:0%
